# Regenerable, large or raw output: keep out of git (see each folder's README).
# These folders end in ".nosync" so iCloud Drive (the repo lives in ~/Documents)
# doesn't sync thousands of PNG writes and create "name 2.png" conflict copies.
*.nosync/
# training-data/ is shared in full (for Esteban), including its .nosync folders
!training-data/**/*.nosync/
# except the raw Crello parquet shards (~365 MB each, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit):
# re-download them, see training-data/references/crello.nosync/README.md
training-data/references/crello.nosync/data/*.parquet
